        "original_id": "33f9e688-c214-5286-916a-4ec44d60b9b0",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John D. Rockefeller III, David Rockefeller, Abby Rockefeller, Nelson Rockefeller, Laurance Rockefeller, Winthrop Rockefeller\n- Organizations: Chase Manhattan Corporation, Japan Society, Americas Society\n- Events: World War II\n\nFacts:\n- David Rockefeller was born on June 12, 1915.\n- John D. Rockefeller III had siblings named Abby Rockefeller, Nelson Rockefeller, Laurance Rockefeller, Winthrop Rockefeller, and David Rockefeller.\n- Japan Society suspended all activities during World War II.\n- Japan Society expanded under the leadership of John D. Rockefeller III after World War II.\n- David Rockefeller established the Americas Society in 1965.\n- David Rockefeller was an American banker who served as chairman and chief executive of Chase Manhattan Corporation.\n- David Rockefeller died on March 20, 2017.",
